ABOUT: 

Quantomatic was a piece of software for reasoning about monoidal theories. In particular, it was designed to reason about quantum information processing.

It is no longer being actively maintained. While there is no direct successor to this project, there are two more recent projects that have some similar features/goals to Quantomatic:

ZX Live - https://github.com/zxcalc/zxlive
Chyp - https://github.com/akissinger/chyp


